# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4357
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%.25s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Since they are different users, they won't be reading/writing\n"
"the same ~/.xscreensaver file, so %s isn't\n"
"going to work right.\n"
"\n"
"You should either re-run %s as \"%s\", or re-run\n"
"xscreensaver as \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"%s s'està executant com a usuari \"%s\"a l'amfitrió\"%s\".\n"
"Però la pantalla de gestió de XScreenSaver \"%.25s\"\n"
"s'està executant com a usuari \"%s\"a l'amfitrió\"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Com que són usuaris diferents, no estaran llegint/escrivint\n"
"el mateix fitxer ~/.xscreensaver, per tant %s no ho és\n"
"anar a treballar bé.\n"
"\n"
"Hauríeu de tornar a executar %s com \"%s\", o torna a executar\n"
"xscreensaver com a \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Reinicieu ara el dimoni XScreenSaver?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4381
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"If those two machines don't share a file system (that is,\n"
"if they don't see the same ~%s/.xscreensaver file) then\n"
"%s won't work right.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the daemon on \"%s\" as \"%s\" now?\n"
msgstr ""
"s'està executant com a usuari \"%s\" a l'amfitrió \"%s\".%s s'està executant "
"com a usuari \"%s\" a l'amfitrió \"%s\".\n"
"Però la pantalla de gestió de XScreenSaver \"%s\"\n"
"\n"
"%s no funcionarà bé.Si aquestes dues màquines no comparteixen un sistema de "
"fitxers (és a dir,\n"
"si no veuen el mateix fitxer ~%s/.xscreensaver), aleshores\n"
"\n"
"Reinicieu el dimoni a \"%s\" com a \"%s\" ara?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4402
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is %s version %s.\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is version %s.  This could cause problems.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"Aquesta és la versió %s %s.\n"
"Però la pantalla de gestió de XScreenSaver \"%s\"\n"
"és la versió %s.  Això podria causar problemes.\n"
"\n"
"Reinicieu ara el dimoni XScreenSaver?\n"

