msgstr "Malabarista Amiga"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Una recreació en temps real de la demostració Amiga \"Juggler\" d'Eric "
"Graham de 1987: un GLSL\n"
"port del seu traçador de raigs recursiu. El robot, les pilotes, el tauler "
"d'escacs\n"
"Els reflexos del sòl i del mirall es generen i es tracen de manera "
"procedimental.\n"
"\n"
"Escrit per Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "

