#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"This screen saver was removed from the XScreenSaver distribution as of\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"A cellular automaton that is really a two-dimensional Turing machine:\n"
"as the heads (\"ants\") walk along the screen, they change pixel\n"
"values in their path.  Then, as they pass over changed pixels, their\n"
"behavior is influenced.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Written by David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Aquest protector de pantalla es va eliminar de la distribució XScreenSaver a "
"partir de\n"
"versió 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"Un autòmat cel·lular que és realment una màquina de Turing bidimensional:\n"
"a mesura que els caps (\"formigues\") caminen per la pantalla, canvien de "
"píxel\n"
"valors al seu pas.  Aleshores, a mesura que passen per sobre dels píxels "
"canviats, els seus\n"
"el comportament està influenciat.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Escrit per David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "

