# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:1
msgid "Epicycle"
msgstr "Epicicle"

#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:12
msgid "Harmonics"
msgstr "Harmònics"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"A pre-heliocentric model of planetary motion.\n"
"\n"
"This draws the path traced out by a point on the edge of a\n"
"circle.  That circle rotates around a point on the rim of another\n"
"circle, and so on, several times.\n"
"\n"
"The geometry of epicycles was perfected by Hipparchus of Rhodes at some "
"time\n"
"around 125 B.C., 185 years after the birth of Aristarchus of Samos, the\n"
"inventor of the heliocentric universe model.  Hipparchus applied epicycles "
"to\n"
"the Sun and the Moon.  Ptolemy of Alexandria went on to apply them to what "
"was\n"
"then the known universe, at around 150 A.D.  Copernicus went on to apply "
"them\n"
"to the heliocentric model at the beginning of the sixteenth century.  "
"Johannes\n"
"Kepler discovered that the planets actually move in elliptical orbits in "
"about\n"
"1602.  The inverse-square law of gravity was suggested by Boulliau in 1645.\n"
"Isaac Newton's Principia Mathematica was published in 1687, and proved that\n"
"Kepler's laws derived from Newtonian gravitation.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Written by James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Un model pre-heliocèntric del moviment planetari.\n"
"\n"
"Això dibuixa el camí traçat per un punt a la vora d'a\n"
"cercle.  Aquest cercle gira al voltant d'un punt a la vora d'un altre\n"
"cercle, i així successivament, diverses vegades.\n"
"\n"
"La geometria dels epicicles va ser perfeccionada per Hiparc de Rodes en "
"algun moment\n"
"cap al 125 a.C., 185 anys després del naixement d'Aristarc de Samos, el\n"
"inventor del model de l'univers heliocèntric.  Hiparc va aplicar epicicles "
"a\n"
"el Sol i la Lluna.  Ptolemeu d'Alexandria va passar a aplicar-los al que "
"era\n"
"després l'univers conegut, cap a l'any 150 dC Copèrnic els va aplicar\n"
"al model heliocèntric de principis del segle XVI.  Johannes\n"
"Kepler va descobrir que els planetes en realitat es mouen en òrbites "
"el·líptiques aproximadament\n"
"1602. La llei del quadrat invers de la gravetat va ser suggerida per "
"Boulliau el 1645.\n"
"Els Principia Mathematica d'Isaac Newton es van publicar l'any 1687 i ho van "
"demostrar\n"
"Lleis de Kepler derivades de la gravitació newtoniana.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Escrit per James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "

