msgid "Esper"
msgstr "Esper"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/esper.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"\"Enhance 224 to 176. Pull out track right. Center in pull back.  Pull\n"
"back. Wait a minute. Go right. Stop. Enhance 57 19. Track 45 left.\n"
"Gimme a hardcopy right there.\"\n"
"\n"
"The Esper Machine was a voice-controlled forensic device used by LAPD\n"
"in 2019, as documented in the 1982 film, Blade Runner.  It was capable\n"
"of enhancing photographs to an extreme degree, including reconstructing\n"
"different viewpoints within the space from the reflections on various\n"
"objects in the photograph.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\"Millora 224 a 176. Traieu la pista cap a la dreta. Centreu-lo tireu "
"enrere. Estireu\n"
"enrere. Espera un moment. Ves a la dreta. Atureu-vos. Millora 57 19. Pista "
"45 esquerra.\n"
"Dona'm una còpia impresa allà mateix\".\n"
"\n"
"La màquina Esper era un dispositiu forense controlat per veu utilitzat pel "
"LAPD\n"
"el 2019, tal com es documenta a la pel·lícula de 1982, Blade Runner.  Era "
"capaç\n"
"de millorar les fotografies fins a un grau extrem, inclosa la reconstrucció\n"
"diferents punts de vista dins l'espai a partir de les reflexions sobre "
"diversos\n"
"objectes de la fotografia.\n"
"\n"
"Escrit per Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "

