msgid "Blur smoothness"
msgstr "Suavitat del borrós"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/glblur.xml.h:18
msgid ""
"\n"
"Flowing field effects from the vapor trails around a moving object.\n"
"\n"
"This is done by rendering the scene into a small texture, then\n"
"repeatedly rendering increasingly-enlarged and increasingly-transparent\n"
"versions of that texture onto the frame buffer.  As such, it's quite\n"
"GPU-intensive: if you don't have a very good graphics card, it\n"
"will hurt your machine bad.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2002.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Efectes de camp que flueixen dels rastres de vapor al voltant d'un objecte "
"en moviment.\n"
"\n"
"Això es fa convertint l'escena en una textura petita, doncs\n"
"repetidament fent-se cada cop més ampliat i cada cop més transparent\n"
"versions d'aquesta textura a la memòria intermèdia.  Com a tal, és bastant\n"
"Intensiu GPU: si no tens una targeta gràfica molt bona, això\n"
"farà mal a la teva màquina.\n"
"\n"
"Escrit per Jamie Zawinski; 2002.\n"
"  "

