#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Repairs burn-in on LCD monitors.  This saver is functional,\n"
"rather than pretty.\n"
"\n"
"Believe it or not, screen burn is not a thing of the past.\n"
"It can happen to LCD screens pretty easily, even in this modern age.\n"
"However, leaving the screen on and displaying high contrast images\n"
"can often repair the damage.  That's what this screen saver does.\n"
"\n"
"See also:\n"
"https://web.archive.org/web/20020817075924/http%3A//docs.info.apple.com/"
"article.html?artnum=88343\n"
"\n"
"Inspired by a like-named and long-defunct program by Daniel Sandler.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2008.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"més que bonic.Repara la cremada en monitors LCD.  Aquest estalviador és "
"funcional,\n"
"\n"
"Ho creieu o no, la gravació de pantalles no és cosa del passat.\n"
"Pot passar a les pantalles LCD amb força facilitat, fins i tot en aquesta "
"època moderna.\n"
"Tanmateix, deixant la pantalla encesa i mostrant imatges d'alt contrast\n"
"sovint pot reparar el dany.  Això és el que fa aquest salvapantalles.\n"
"\n"
"Veure també:\n"
"https://web.archive.org/web/20020817075924/http%3A//docs.info.apple.com/"
"article.html?artnum=88343\n"
"\n"
"Inspirat en un programa amb el mateix nom i desaparegut de Daniel Sandler.\n"
"\n"
"Escrit per Jamie Zawinski; 2008.\n"
"  "

